# ERPNext / backend API
# Base URL of the ERPNext (Frappe) REST API. Points at a local bench in dev,
# and the real ERPNext instance in production. Leave as-is until the backend
# from the architecture doc (Section 10) is live — Login and Register will
# fail gracefully with a clear error until then.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api

# Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com) — free, no backend required.
# Get a key by entering an email at web3forms.com (use nabeel.munawar@gmail.com
# so submissions land there) — takes under a minute, no account/password needed.
# Contact, Request a demo, and the newsletter signup all use this key.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
